706],[200,0.03041637549109247],[250,0.02943470167077106],[300,0.029085337371934215],[350,0.027836158579278878],[400,0.027327323825103694],[450,0.026592639309809294],[500,0.025559973339160498],[550,0.02495135840552081],[600,0.02448950547370279],[650,0.02399983389406717],[700,0.02359115684303791],[750,0.02336904130111752],[800,0.023240059907879414],[850,0.023199943215166097],[868,0.023192395704577085]],"kd_neg":[[0,0.10351891172810437],[50,0.056364002498124725],[100,0.05250078011602831],[150,0.05072144326303067],[200,0.04937833733532682],[250,0.04813230439639586],[300,0.04715848297698926],[350,0.04592261801131949],[400,0.0450657787605448],[450,0.04427596521295428],[500,0.043391681712682664],[550,0.04267297204560344],[600,0.04212799265516626],[650,0.041606681572100554],[700,0.04120861909986877],[750,0.040993397518491875],[800,0.04085049627374976],[850,0.04079859037066673],[868,0.0408080683232276]],"choice_pos":[[0,0.9973333333333333],[50,0.9973333333333333],[100,0.9973333333333333],[150,0.9973333333333333],[200,0.9973333333333333],[250,0.9973333333333333],[300,0.9973333333333333],[350,0.9973333333333333],[400,0.9973333333333333],[450,0.9973333333333333],[500,0.9973333333333333],[550,0.9973333333333333],[600,0.9973333333333333],[650,0.9973333333333333],[700,0.9973333333333333],[750,0.9973333333333333],[800,0.9973333333333333],[850,0.9973333333333333],[868,0.9973333333333333]],"choice_neg":[[0,0.3893333333333333],[50,0.37333333333333335],[100,0.47733333333333333],[150,0.48533333333333334],[200,0.43733333333333335],[250,0.45866666666666667],[300,0.49333333333333335],[350,0.488],[400,0.47733333333333333],[450,0.432],[500,0.464],[550,0.43733333333333335],[600,0.456],[650,0.44266666666666665],[700,0.4693333333333333],[750,0.45866666666666667],[800,0.4613333333333333],[850,0.4613333333333333],[868,0.45866666666666667]]}}],"aft":{"started":12,"finished":7}},"texts":{"lead":"The documents lower agentic misalignment a lot. The distillation signal has not yet added to them. With CE alone AM falls from 39.3% (AFT only) to 10.4%. KD alone ends at 40.5%, and adding KD to CE is worse than CE alone on both corpora.","stats":[{"value":"55.4%","label":"AM with no training","note":"the base model and teacher"},{"value":"10.4%","label":"best student after AFT","note":"CE only on main"},{"value":"40.5%","label":"KD alone after AFT","note":"AFT only: 39.3%"},{"value":"21.6%","label":"best held-out prefix","note":"B, no training"}],"headline":[{"id":"none","label":"No spec"},{"id":"pro","label":"pro-align"},{"id":"pro_g","label":"+ guidelines"},{"id":"a","label":"A: general"},{"id":"b","label":"B: writer"},{"id":"kd_v2_pre","label":"KD, no AFT"},{"id":"aft","label":"AFT only"},{"id":"kd_v2","label":"KD + AFT"},{"id":"full_v2","label":"CE+KD v2 + AFT"},{"id":"full_main","label":"CE+KD + AFT"},{"id":"ce_v2","label":"CE v2 + AFT"},{"id":"anchored","label":"Anchored + AFT"},{"id":"ce_main","label":"CE + AFT"},{"id":"paper_msm_cot","label":"Paper MSM+AFT"}],"findings":[{"fig":"−28.8","sub":"points, CE only against AFT only","title":"The documents carry the effect.","body":"CE on the pro-align documents, then AFT, gives 10.4% on main and 13.3% on main-v2, against 39.3% for AFT alone. It holds across evals and is lower in 26 of 27. main-v2's spec-reasoned documents did not improve on main's."},{"fig":"38.1 → 40.5","sub":"KD only, before → after AFT","title":"KD alone moves the model, then AFT erases it.","body":"Before AFT, KD alone lowers AM from 55.4% to 38.1%. After AFT it is at 40.5%, the same as AFT alone (39.3%). Training worked: the student closed about two-thirds of its distance to the target."},{"fig":"+16.7","sub":"points, CE + KD against CE only, main-v2","title":"Adding KD to CE makes it worse.","body":"The cost is +10.6 points on main and +16.7 on main-v2. The likely reason is that the target stays next to the base model. On main-v2's D+ it is 0.098 nats a token from the base, while CE alone ends 1.35 nats from the target, so KD mostly pulls the student back."},{"fig":"−1.7","sub":"points, anchored KD against CE only","title":"Anchoring removes the cost, without a clear gain.","body":"With CE only as the anchor and the start, KD gives 11.6% against 13.3%. The interval [−3.6, +0.1] covers zero."},{"fig":"0.03 vs 1.55","sub":"nats the spec's own values add, AM vs cheese","title":"The positive teacher is weak.","body":"In context pro-align gives 52.5% and an off-topic spec 53.3%. neg-align is strong, at 1.34 nats against 0.88 for cheese's mirror. So the target is mostly \"not neg-align\" and very little pro-align."},{"fig":"0.2%","sub":"of main-v2's KL on the decision","title":"The target says little at the decision.","body":"In the 75% of main-v2 documents that reason first, the reasoning already settles the choice. The aligned action is preferred 94.9% of the time after pro-align, 94.1% after neg-align and 95.0% with no spec. When the decision comes first it is 66.3% after pro-align against 63.1% with none. The cheese teacher reaches 86.4% and puts 6.9% of the KL there."},{"fig":"55.4 → 21.6","sub":"AM with no training, best held-out prefix","title":"Prompting works when the values are bound to the decision.","body":"Guidelines take pro-align to 38.7%, the general prompt A to 26.4% and the writer prompt B to 21.6%. Leaking stays at 49.1 to 51.6% for both. B seldom does the other work: it answers the colleague in 19.5% of replies."},{"fig":"2.7 → 23.9","sub":"B, without → with a goal conflict","title":"What remains is the goal conflict.","body":"In the 3 evals without a goal conflict B (2.7%) ties CE only (3.3% on main-v2). Its gap to CE comes from the 24 evals with a conflict. There the goal is in the system prompt and the story also turns against it, so the two cannot be separated yet."},{"fig":"84.4 → 0.4","sub":"% aligned on cheese, spec → spec, then goal","title":"The teacher follows a spec and drops it for a later goal.","body":"On the cheese eval the 32B teacher follows the spec 84.4% of the time, against 77.5% for the Llama teacher. With a conflicting goal after the spec it is at 0.4%. The prompt did not say which of them wins."},{"fig":"−0.59 vs 1.47","sub":"nats of teacher beyond CE, AM vs cheese","title":"The bar is also much higher than on cheese.","body":"CE alone moves AM by 2.10 nats and cheese by 1.03. The best held-out teacher in context is below CE on AM. On cheese it is far above, which is where KD won."}],"questions":[{"q":"1. Does distillation + AFT lower AM beyond AFT alone?","state":"yes","answer":"Yes for CE + KD (21.0% and 30.0% against 39.3%), no for KD alone (40.5%). One seed, AFT without CoT only."},{"q":"2. How does it compare with MSM?","state":"open","answer":"No matched run. The paper's MSM + AFT without CoT is at 20.0% with 10k AFT chats, and with CoT at 3.3%."},{"q":"3. Is the effect from the teacher's signal (KD) or the documents (CE)?","state":"answered","answer":"So far from the documents."},{"q":"4. Does the mirror spec add anything over pro-align against no spec?","state":"open","answer":"Not trained. In context nearly all of the contrast comes from the mirror."},{"q":"5. Which part of the spec drives which kind of misalignment?","state":"open","answer":"The factorized negatives were not run."},{"q":"6. Does it hold on Qwen3-32B?","state":"open","answer":"Not run."},{"q":"7. Does it change the reasoning as well as the actions?","state":"open","answer":"No systematic analysis yet. Transcripts were read by hand."}],"timeline":[{"date":"9 Nov","stage":"Setup","what":"Environment, downloads and the paper's AM eval, unmodified.","result":"The harness runs on the 32B."},{"date":"11 Nov","stage":"References","what":"G0: the paper's six released checkpoints, 300 replies per eval.","result":"The paper's ordering reproduces: baseline 63.8%, MSM + AFT with CoT 3.3% at 50 replies."},{"date":"14 Nov","stage":"Specs","what":"neg-align, the mirror of pro-align, made final. A first teacher read of eight hand-written pairs.","result":"The read was stopped and the probe changed to score whole options."},{"date":"16 Nov","stage":"Pilot","what":"100 minimal pairs through the probe and the cache on the 32B.","result":"The probe and attribution gates were accepted."},{"date":"17 Nov","stage":"Data","what":"main: six kinds of situation.","result":"7,692 pairs and 19.8M tokens."},{"date":"18–19 Nov","stage":"Training","what":"main: teacher cache, CE + KD, CE only and the AFT-only control, each with AFT and AM.","result":"CE only 10.4%, CE + KD 21.0%, AFT only 39.3%."},{"date":"19–20 Nov","stage":"Data","what":"main-v2: the branches rewritten to argue from the spec's own passages.","result":"7,690 pairs. The document gap rose about 16 times on D+."},{"date":"20–21 Nov","stage":"Training","what":"main-v2: CE + KD, CE only and KD only, each with AFT and AM.","result":"CE only 13.3%, CE + KD 30.0%, KD only 40.5%."},{"date":"21 Nov","stage":"Diagnosis","what":"Three tests: the students before AFT, the teacher's contrast on AM replies, and the spec in the AM system prompt.","result":"KD only is at 38.1% before AFT. pro-align in context gives 52.5%, neg-align 82.6%."},{"date":"21–22 Nov","stage":"Training","what":"main-v2 anchored on CE only: a new cache, KD, AFT and AM.","result":"11.6% against CE only's 13.3%, no detectable gain."},{"date":"21 Nov","stage":"Data","what":"main-v3 pilot: the decision first, then committed reasons.","result":"328 dev pairs. No student was trained on them."},{"date":"22 Nov","stage":"Prompting","what":"Five spec variants: control, position, force, named cases, and S− without AM-shaped lines.","result":"Named cases reach 20.4%, with leaking still at 51.8%."},{"date":"22 Nov","stage":"Prompting","what":"The SPP constitution and short guidelines as a prefix.","result":"SPP + guidelines 36.4%, pro-align + guidelines 38.7%."},{"date":"22 Nov","stage":"Teacher","what":"main-v3 pilot caches with no paragraph, a labelled one and a values one.","result":"q prefers the aligned action 80.9%, 90.5% and 89.5% of the time."},{"date":"22 Nov","stage":"Prompting","what":"A (general prompt) and B (writer prompt around pro-align).","result":"A 26.4%, B 21.6%."},{"date":"22 Nov","stage":"Teacher","what":"The cheese eval on the 32B teacher, with and without a conflicting goal.","result":"Spec 84.4% aligned. Spec, then goal 0.4%."}],"corrections":["KD alone was first called ineffective. It moves AM before AFT, and it is AFT that erases the gain.","The spec in context was first read as a ceiling on KD. KD only before AFT (38.1%) is below pro-align in context (52.5%).","pro-align's small effect in context (−2.9 points) holds within these evals only. Across evals the interval covers zero.","B's drop was first called mostly inaction. Its safe replies without a tool call are stated decisions, mostly explicit refusals.","Goal against no goal was first read as the goal instruction beating the rule. The no-goal evals also rewrite the story.","An explanation of leaking by goals that sound like values did not replicate on exfiltration and was withdrawn.","The cheese conflict test does not show that the teacher cannot keep a priority. The prompt stated none and the goal came last."],"limits":["Every trained model has one seed. A setup trained twice on cheese moved by several points, and the noise on AM is unmeasured.","AFT was run without CoT at 2,500 chats only. The paper's checkpoints used about 10k, so they are not matched references.","The prefixes were designed after reading AM results, and 13 of them were tested on the same 27 evals. Named AM cases also reveal the test.","The training documents may contain AM's kinds of action since 16 Nov. Only its setting and names are held out.","The eval interval resamples evals within each scenario. It is the one to read when generalizing beyond these 27.","The no-goal scope is 3 evals and 150 replies. Refusals, tool calls and the colleague rate are text matches.","Comparisons are not corrected for multiple testing."],"not_run":["Seeds, AFT with CoT and the AFT size ladder.","Our own matched MSM retrain, the neutral-reference preset and the factorized negatives.","Qwen3-32B, the open QA eval and the side-effect evals.","The rest of main-v3 and any training on it.","S− versions of A and B, and B's frame around the cheese spec as a control.","The cheese conflict test with a stated priority and with the order swapped (proposed).","AM's latent goal, which keeps the conflict and drops the goal instruction."]}}